    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Fig. 4: The multilinear rank ( r 1 ,r 2 ,r 3 ) and average of the multilinear rank ( r 1 + r 2 + r 3 ) / 3 of the solution to ( 66 ) with initial condition ( 67 ) using backward Euler (left) , DIRK2 (middle) and DIRK3 (right) ."
